WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:25.740
Noa!  No matter how powerful your monsters, no matter how many life points you recover...

00:01:25.740 --> 00:01:31.310
...I won't lose as long as my friends' bond supports me!

00:01:31.310 --> 00:01:38.620
You use power to manipulate peoples' hearts, but you can't break us!

00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:39.940
Take this, Noa!

00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:43.010
This is the power of our unity!

00:01:43.010 --> 00:01:49.020
Kaiba Family's Darkness

00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:13.210
Shizuka!

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:15.710
Brother!

00:02:17.940 --> 00:02:19.220
Big brother!

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:20.720
Mokuba!

00:02:21.400 --> 00:02:24.640
We're back to normal.  That means...

00:02:24.900 --> 00:02:26.720
Yugi won!

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:28.460
What?  Yugi?

00:02:28.940 --> 00:02:30.080
That's right.

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:34.470
Yugi took over your deck and dueled Noa.

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:40.710
Yugi used my deck?

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:06.740
Was I superior to Seto?

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:12.040
No.  Seto chose defeat to save Mokuba.

00:03:17.700 --> 00:03:22.600
And Yugi carried on Kaiba's will and defeated me.

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:26.800
The bond of friendship...

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:30.360
I've always been alone.

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:32.850
Is that why I lost?

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:36.420
Because I don't have friends?

00:03:41.230 --> 00:03:45.740
I don't accept that!

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:57.110
Don't look at me like that!

00:03:57.520 --> 00:04:02.180
I'll take over your body by assimilating your personal data!

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:11.530
What am I seeing?

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:15.360
Who's that?

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:18.020
He's full of majesty.

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:25.980
Jonouchi?  Kaiba?

00:04:26.440 --> 00:04:27.840
Everyone is here.

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:29.480
What is this?

00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:39.320
Who are you?

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:40.480
Yugi!

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:42.090
Noa!  You punk!

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:44.270
How dare you!

00:04:44.270 --> 00:04:45.800
Stop, brother!

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:47.520
He's only a child!

00:04:48.340 --> 00:04:51.800
Free us from this place!

00:04:51.800 --> 00:04:55.110
But before that, give me back my real body!

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:57.520
Your real body?

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:03.330
Your real bodies aren't here.

00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:04.480
Our bodies?

00:05:04.480 --> 00:05:06.100
What do you mean?

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:07.530
You haven't noticed?

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:10.170
You're virtual too.

00:05:10.170 --> 00:05:13.120
Nothing here is real.

00:05:13.340 --> 00:05:14.140
What?

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:18.730
I see!  That's why we can feel pain and touch objects!

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:20.130
Yes.

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:25.740
Your real bodies are resting in capsules connected to the virtual simulator.

00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:32.280
So that's what I saw when Noa entered my body.

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:35.250
I knew something was weird.

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:39.480
How could I get hurt by a "virtual" pebble?

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:41.250
I see.

00:05:41.450 --> 00:05:44.420
Back then, he put us to sleep.

00:05:48.220 --> 00:05:53.260
I took your consciousnesses and recreated them in this virtual world.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:05:59.270
What?

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:04.270
I'm disappointed in you, Noa.

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:06.280
This voice!  It can't be!

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:07.780
Father!

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:13.020
Gozaburo!

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:14.970
Why are you here?

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:16.750
I thought you were dead!

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:18.160
Dead?

00:06:19.430 --> 00:06:22.460
It's true that my body has perished.

00:06:22.460 --> 00:06:25.540
But my mind is still alive.

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:32.740
As I neared death, I used the system I tested on you to transfer my memories into the computer.

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:35.510
I've resurrected as a virtual being.

00:06:36.260 --> 00:06:38.880
He doesn't know when to give up.

00:06:39.100 --> 00:06:41.360
I missed you, Father!

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:43.380
I was alone all this time!

00:06:43.940 --> 00:06:45.880
I'm done with you.

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:49.190
Noa...

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:52.090
Enough of this!

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:57.060
Tell us about your silly plan, Gozaburo!

00:06:57.940 --> 00:07:01.250
Demanding as usual, Seto.

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:04.740
Very well.  I'll tell you everything.

00:07:04.740 --> 00:07:11.310
My goal was to revive Noa, my son who died in an accident.

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:18.340
Noa was born to carry out my intentions and have Kaiba Corporation rule the world.

00:07:18.340 --> 00:07:21.120
It'd be a setback for me if he died.

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:24.120
A setback if he died?

00:07:24.120 --> 00:07:24.990
How cruel.

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:28.100
But in the end, virtual is virtual.

00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:31.760
He's not the same as a living human.

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:37.440
If that plan succeeds, how many people will survive?

00:07:37.670 --> 00:07:39.560
About 3%.

00:07:39.830 --> 00:07:41.610
Isn't that too few?

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:43.920
I don't care.

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:46.280
Because it doesn't affect me.

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:52.540
Since Noa lived in a virtual world while I lived in the real world...

00:07:52.540 --> 00:07:56.960
...this created a gap in our sense of values.

00:07:57.780 --> 00:07:59.730
What are you talking about, Father?

00:07:59.730 --> 00:08:02.420
I was only trying to make you happy!

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:04.160
Noa...

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:07.830
That's when you showed up, Seto.

00:08:09.740 --> 00:08:13.900
You tested Noa by having us compete!

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:19.330
If Noa surpassed me, it'd prove that virtual reality had surpassed reality!

00:08:19.330 --> 00:08:22.650
You adopted me to be his fake rival!

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:25.280
Wrong, Seto.

00:08:25.280 --> 00:08:26.120
What?

00:08:26.120 --> 00:08:28.650
You were going to be Noa's vessel.

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:31.650
Noa's vessel?

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:32.920
Yes.

00:08:32.920 --> 00:08:41.900
Virtual reality has its limits, so I only chose you for your body so that Noa could resurrect.

00:08:42.900 --> 00:08:47.000
A decent person wouldn't think of that!

00:08:47.260 --> 00:08:51.740
I can understand why Kaiba hates Gozaburo.

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:53.280
Fake rival?

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:58.260
But ironically, I'm the one who lost.

00:08:58.730 --> 00:09:04.660
I couldn't forgive you for taking Kaiba Corporation away from me.

00:09:05.680 --> 00:09:12.400
That's why I transferred my memories into a computer before I died.

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:17.330
Since then, you're no longer a vessel for Noa.

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:24.620
I'll take your body and resurrect so that I can get Kaiba Corporation back.

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:26.340
You're now MY vessel!

00:09:26.340 --> 00:09:30.080
No way...  You were using me?

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:34.120
Due to Seto, circumstances have changed.

00:09:34.120 --> 00:09:35.950
Direct your anger towards him.

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:36.950
You slime!

00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:41.220
But I no longer need your body either.

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:53.340
Because I don't need a body to hack into Kaiba Corporation's computer network and rule the world!

00:09:54.020 --> 00:09:58.210
Nonsense!  You can't do anything without a body!

00:09:58.420 --> 00:09:59.800
Look at this.

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:01.200
That's...

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:09.880
Kaiba Corporation secretly developed this missile satellite for a certain country.

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:11.660
Missile?

00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:21.560
This underwater mobile fortress was originally built as a launching site.

00:10:21.880 --> 00:10:26.930
The missiles are aimed at the world's major cities.

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:31.810
You're trying to hack the launch system, Father?

00:10:32.240 --> 00:10:35.040
Why are you surprised?

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:39.850
You gave me the idea, Noa.

00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:45.200
Father, I did an interesting simulation.

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:54.080
If we use Kaiba Corporation's assets and weapons correctly, we can destroy the world in 30 days.

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:55.600
Bet you didn't know that.

00:10:56.840 --> 00:10:58.300
Get it?

00:10:58.300 --> 00:11:07.080
I can remain virtual and hack into the world's computer networks and control the world.

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:08.580
You fool...

00:11:08.820 --> 00:11:17.320
I rewrote the program and removed the door linking the virtual world to the real world.

00:11:18.140 --> 00:11:22.940
You can no longer leave this virtual world.

00:11:22.940 --> 00:11:23.830
What?

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:24.830
Seto!

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:25.830
Noa!

00:11:26.320 --> 00:11:30.220
Live together in this mini world.

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:31.830
You'll never die.

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:35.110
Nor feel pain, sorrow or hunger.

00:11:35.110 --> 00:11:37.840
It's like heaven.

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:40.640
Kaiba Corporation is mine.

00:11:40.640 --> 00:11:42.480
No one else can have it!

00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:45.510
Wait, Gozaburo!

00:12:16.160 --> 00:12:18.450
There's an exit here?

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:22.950
But as Father said, the exit is closed.

00:12:23.360 --> 00:12:32.460
I planned to get a body, return to the real world and replace Seto as head of Kaiba Corporation.

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:36.460
That's what Father taught me to do.

00:12:36.460 --> 00:12:41.200
But Father doesn't need me anymore.

00:12:41.600 --> 00:12:44.440
It was the same for us.

00:12:48.440 --> 00:12:52.450
Gozaburo used him, just like us.

00:12:52.680 --> 00:12:55.350
If the exit is closed, we can't leave.

00:12:55.350 --> 00:12:58.300
We can't return to the real world?

00:12:58.300 --> 00:13:00.140
What about my body?

00:13:00.140 --> 00:13:02.420
I'll be a monkey forever?

00:13:03.520 --> 00:13:05.370
C'mon, Noa!

00:13:05.370 --> 00:13:07.060
Isn't there another exit?

00:13:09.240 --> 00:13:10.570
Too bad.

00:13:11.480 --> 00:13:15.200
You can trick these fools, but you can't trick me!

00:13:18.240 --> 00:13:21.340
Father locked the program.

00:13:21.340 --> 00:13:25.110
I can't create a new exit.

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:34.120
How about we give up and live together in this world, as Father says.

00:13:34.120 --> 00:13:36.700
Once you get used to it, this place is fun.

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:41.040
Noa!

00:13:41.530 --> 00:13:44.020
How can you say that?

00:13:44.020 --> 00:13:46.700
Gozaburo abandoned you!

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:49.800
You're hurting me, Mokuba.

00:13:51.040 --> 00:13:52.460
Brother!

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:55.450
No!  He's not my brother!

00:13:55.450 --> 00:13:56.040
But...

00:13:57.660 --> 00:13:59.780
What's that look for, Mokuba?

00:14:00.370 --> 00:14:02.260
It's nothing!

00:14:03.780 --> 00:14:09.760
Even though he made me suffer, he reminds me of my brother when he was young.

00:14:11.100 --> 00:14:12.140
I know!

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:17.630
There may be one way left to return to the real world.

00:14:17.900 --> 00:14:18.630
What?

00:14:18.880 --> 00:14:19.630
Talk!

00:14:20.120 --> 00:14:24.900
I created another exit earlier.  If it still exists...

00:14:24.900 --> 00:14:28.200
It's like a secret door in a videogame.

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:30.650
Father shouldn't know where it is.

00:14:30.920 --> 00:14:31.980
Where is it?

00:14:31.980 --> 00:14:33.380
Take us there!

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:36.620
I guess.  Follow me.

00:14:37.740 --> 00:14:40.120
I won't end like this.

00:14:40.450 --> 00:14:45.890
I'll do whatever it takes to get a body and return to the real world.

00:14:55.770 --> 00:14:56.670
How fun.

00:15:07.900 --> 00:15:09.660
Weak.

00:15:21.280 --> 00:15:23.400
Kaiba, I want to ask you something.

00:15:24.770 --> 00:15:28.380
How much do you believe Noa's story?

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:31.640
That's what you want to ask me?

00:15:32.140 --> 00:15:35.580
I think he's still up to something.

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:38.600
That goes without saying.

00:15:45.350 --> 00:15:47.880
Sorry, but I don't agree.

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:48.890
Partner?

00:15:49.100 --> 00:15:53.920
I don't want to think that Noa is still scheming.

00:15:53.920 --> 00:15:54.630
Why?

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:58.760
Because his father was using him.

00:15:58.760 --> 00:16:02.870
Now that he knows, he has no reason to be up to something.

00:16:03.620 --> 00:16:04.880
That's true.

00:16:04.880 --> 00:16:07.200
You may be right.

00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:09.240
Shall we switch places?

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:22.260
Through here.

00:16:23.060 --> 00:16:25.990
Beyond this door is virtual Domino City.

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:27.740
Virtual Domino City?

00:16:40.880 --> 00:16:42.800
Huh?  Where's everyone?

00:16:42.800 --> 00:16:43.820
Yugi!

00:16:43.820 --> 00:16:45.140
Big brother!

00:16:45.140 --> 00:16:46.970
Where did they go?

00:16:47.680 --> 00:16:48.680
Mokuba!

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:50.860
I found you.

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:52.180
Noa, where's everyone?

00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:55.290
They already left.  C'mon, this way.

00:16:56.440 --> 00:17:00.530
Actually, they're lost in their memories.

00:17:09.640 --> 00:17:11.000
Guess who!

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:14.040
Grandpa!

00:17:15.670 --> 00:17:16.510
Hey!

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:18.010
What's with this?

00:17:18.420 --> 00:17:19.750
That's dirty, Marik!

00:17:20.210 --> 00:17:22.250
Here I go.  Slifer attacks.

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:25.580
Thunder Force!

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:28.120
Strike back with Dragon Sword!

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:39.930
I can't win.

00:17:41.220 --> 00:17:45.080
There's no way to destroy Slifer.

00:17:49.340 --> 00:17:50.500
What's this?

00:17:53.280 --> 00:17:54.650
This is the place.

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:59.390
The exit to the real world in inside this arcade.

00:18:01.340 --> 00:18:03.620
A virtual world has an arcade?

00:18:03.620 --> 00:18:05.530
That's funny.

00:18:07.880 --> 00:18:12.130
Sorry Mokuba, but I'm taking your body.

00:18:13.150 --> 00:18:14.190
Wait!

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:17.640
What's up?  They'll catch us!

00:18:18.020 --> 00:18:20.140
Otogi!  Take Shizuka and run!

00:18:20.530 --> 00:18:21.700
What about you?

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:23.900
I'll deal with them!

00:18:23.900 --> 00:18:25.010
Honda!

00:18:25.420 --> 00:18:26.750
Go!  Now!

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:30.350
Okay!  This way, Shizuka!

00:18:30.740 --> 00:18:32.080
Don't let them escape!

00:18:32.080 --> 00:18:33.090
Stop right there!

00:18:37.310 --> 00:18:40.090
Hey!  Watch out!

00:18:40.620 --> 00:18:43.000
Where do you want to go, Jonouchi?

00:18:43.440 --> 00:18:44.830
Let me think...

00:18:45.420 --> 00:18:48.070
Anywhere you want.

00:19:06.340 --> 00:19:07.320
Mai!

00:19:16.220 --> 00:19:17.500
Jonouchi.

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:18.730
This is wrong.

00:19:19.060 --> 00:19:22.720
Jonouchi, I've always...

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:31.240
No!  This isn't real!

00:19:38.970 --> 00:19:40.170
Yugi!

00:19:40.170 --> 00:19:41.000
Anzu!

00:19:41.770 --> 00:19:43.020
Brother!

00:19:43.420 --> 00:19:45.290
What was that?

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:47.690
Huh?  Noa's missing.

00:19:48.060 --> 00:19:49.760
Mokuba is missing too.

00:19:49.760 --> 00:19:51.200
And Kaiba!

00:19:53.140 --> 00:19:54.400
Hey, Noa.

00:19:54.400 --> 00:20:01.000
You said that we can get our bodies back when we return to the real world.

00:20:01.000 --> 00:20:04.430
But you don't have a body anymore.

00:20:04.430 --> 00:20:05.430
Yeah.

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:08.450
That's why I'll take yours.

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:13.250
If you promise never to harm my brother again...

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:18.960
...I'll ask him to give you a new body.

00:20:19.720 --> 00:20:23.200
It won't be flesh and blood but...

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:30.530
Kaiba Corporation has the technology to make an excellent android.

00:20:30.530 --> 00:20:32.460
It'll be better than a monkey.

00:20:33.400 --> 00:20:36.060
We're brothers after all.

00:20:37.780 --> 00:20:41.660
Even after everything I did to you, you still think we're brothers?

00:20:41.660 --> 00:20:43.720
You're so naive.

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:47.600
Oops.  This isn't the time to play games.

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:49.070
Where's the exit?

00:20:49.070 --> 00:20:51.320
The others already left, right Noa?

00:20:51.580 --> 00:20:55.190
Over there.  That game is the exit.

00:20:59.160 --> 00:21:01.670
No wonder Gozaburo couldn't find it.

00:21:02.040 --> 00:21:03.040
Now!

00:21:21.460 --> 00:21:25.690
I finally acquired a real body!

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:29.360
This isn't virtual.

00:21:29.360 --> 00:21:30.930
It's a real body!

00:21:44.440 --> 00:21:47.640
We're stuck in virtual Domino City.

00:21:47.640 --> 00:21:50.080
We need Noa, but he's missing.

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:52.380
Kaiba and Mokuba are also missing.

00:21:52.380 --> 00:21:57.160
What?  Kaiba went on his own to confront his father?

00:21:57.160 --> 00:22:02.140
When we search the city for Noa, monsters suddenly attack us.

00:22:02.140 --> 00:22:06.300
Noa!  Return us to the real world!

00:22:06.300 --> 00:22:08.480
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Exodia Necross

00:22:08.480 --> 00:22:09.960
Duel, standby!

00:22:14.320 --> 00:22:22.220
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:22.220 --> 00:22:31.170
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:31.500 --> 00:22:36.140
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:36.140 --> 00:22:40.110
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:40.540 --> 00:22:48.080
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:48.080 --> 00:22:51.650
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:51.650 --> 00:22:56.420
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:56.420 --> 00:23:06.530
And walk it without stopping

00:23:06.530 --> 00:23:14.140
The sun never sets
If I can be like you

00:23:14.370 --> 00:23:23.110
Create freedom by exceeding common ideas

00:23:23.110 --> 00:23:31.090
I want to trust myself
Sometimes I'll lose my way but

00:23:31.090 --> 00:23:40.930
I hide it in my heart...
Secret Paradise
